..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : CONTAINERDETAIL.SE
.. Author         : cl
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : mh
.. Functionality  :
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
.type text xti       ? _F|defined(U|xti)
.type date xd1       ? _F|defined(U|xd1)
.type text xam xdatum xad xaj xem
..
.. Selektion beldat
.copy M|bbeldat = G|TRUE
.formula P|maskkontextfop   = ""
.continue END ? _F|empty(M|von) & _F|empty(M|bis)
..
.. Vormonat als Bereich w„hlen / set first day of previous month
.formula U|xd1 = G|datum
.formula U|xaj = F|year(U|xd1)
.formula U|xam = F|month(U|xd1)
.formula U|xam = ("00" + U|xam) >> 2
.formula U|xdatum = 'U|xaj' + 'U|xam' + "01"
.formula U|xd1 = U|xdatum 
.formula U|xd1 = U|xd1 - 1
.formula M|bis = U|xd1
.formula U|xd1 = M|bis
.formula U|xaj = F|year(U|xd1)
.formula U|xam = F|month(U|xd1)
.formula U|xad = F|day(U|xd1)
.formula U|xam = ("00" + U|xam) >> 2
.formula U|xdatum = 'U|xaj' + 'U|xam' + "01"
.formula M|von = U|xdatum
.continue END
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
